=== C. earnings release time -> first session that can react ===
release 2026-02-03 Tue 07:00 ET (before the open): day 0 = 2026-02-03 Tue; that day's open usable? True
release 2026-02-04 Wed 12:30 ET (during the session): day 0 = 2026-02-04 Wed; that day's open usable? False
release 2026-02-05 Thu 16:05 ET (after the close (Thu)): day 0 = 2026-02-06 Fri; that day's open usable? True
release 2026-02-06 Fri 16:05 ET (after the close (Fri)): day 0 = 2026-02-09 Mon; that day's open usable? True
only the 8-K is stored: accepted 2026-02-05 16:20 ET -> day 0 2026-02-06 (same as the release here;
  an 8-K is due within four business days, so its time can be later than the release; using it never looks ahead)
